# Smarty templates, https://www.smarty.net
#
# A layer over HTML: the tags of Smarty are colored wherever they stand, in
# the text, inside an HTML tag, in a string of an attribute, in a script or a
# style sheet, and HTML, with the scripts and style sheets it embeds, reads
# the rest with the tags left out.
#
# As in Smarty itself, a brace followed by a blank is no tag, so the braces
# of scripts and style sheets stay theirs.  What {literal} holds is read as
# tags all the same.

overlay HTML\sFile

context default
    # a brace and a blank: no tag
    keyword {\s
    keyword {\t
    keyword {\n

# a comment
context {\* \*} brown

# a tag: {$variable}, {function ...}, {block} and {/block}
context { } brightcyan
    embed soft Smarty\sTag
